	(text "MCU sheet notes\n- Supply: VDD and VDDH both on 3V3 (normal-voltage mode); DCCH unused. REG1 runs in LDO\n  mode (firmware DCDCEN=0): the 10 uH ferrite would saturate in the MagSafe magnet field,\n  so the DC/DC inductors are DNP footprints. VBUS from USB for the USBD peripheral.\n- Removed wearable-only nets copied from the wearable MCU sheet: CTRL_SPDT, Mod_Sel0/1,\n  PMIC_Status0-2, Sensor_SDA/SCL/INT/EN, QSPI_CLK.\n- GPIO map: SYN_SCK P0.19, SYN_MUXOUT P0.20, SYN_SDI P0.21, SYN_CSB P0.22, SYN_CE P0.23,\n  I2C SCL P0.13 / SDA P0.15, PA_EN P0.02, LNA_PD P0.26, 3V3_PG P0.03, LED P1.06,\n  BUTTON P1.09, UART TX P0.06 / RX P0.08, spares P0.28 / P0.04 / P0.05, SWO P1.00.\n- P0.02, P0.03, P0.28 and P1.06 are radio-sensitive (<=10 kHz, standard drive):\n  used only for static enables, PG and the LED.\n- No 32.768 kHz crystal: use the internal LFRC (XL1/XL2 left open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 650 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27))
			(justify left top))
		(uuid "ccb39861-f857-5ae8-9d0f-5472e08fc7b2"))
